desc_save => Save camera events to this chart's camera data file.
desc_save_as => Choose a different location for camera event data.
desc_open_chart => Open another chart or camera event data file.
desc_exit_editor => Exit the editor and return to the editor menu.
desc_undo => Undo the last event or layer change.
desc_redo => Redo the last undone change.
desc_copy => Copy selected camera events.
desc_cut => Cut selected camera events.
desc_paste => Paste copied events at the playhead.
desc_duplicate => Quickly duplicate selected events to the next beat.
desc_delete => Delete selected events.
desc_select_all => Select every camera event in the chart.
desc_new_event => Create a camera event at the playhead.
desc_play_pause => Play or pause the chart preview.
desc_go_start => Move the playhead to the start of the song.
desc_timeline_zoom_in => Zoom in to inspect shorter time spans.
desc_timeline_zoom_out => Zoom out to see more of the song.
desc_timeline_zoom_reset => Restore the default timeline scale.
desc_add_layer => Create a camera event layer.
desc_remove_layer => Delete the current layer and choose how to handle its events.
desc_move_layer_up => Raise the current layer's display order.
desc_move_layer_down => Lower the current layer's display order.
desc_focus_opponent => Add an event that focuses the opponent at the playhead.
desc_focus_player => Add an event that focuses the player at the playhead.
desc_focus_girlfriend => Add an event that focuses the girlfriend at the playhead.
desc_reset_camera_position => Reset preview camera position.
desc_reset_camera_zoom => Reset preview camera zoom.
desc_toggle_strum_preview => Show or hide chart note previews.
desc_toggle_passepartout => Show or hide the area outside the viewfinder.
desc_toggle_extended_bounds => Show or hide extended camera bounds.
desc_toggle_shader => Toggle preview scene shaders.
desc_show_help => Show camera, timeline, and mouse operation instructions.
desc_show_keybindings => Open the keyboard shortcut configuration.
